            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in CapyBar 1.0.7</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Thermal now follows macOS thermal pressure, so the pill can leave Cool when the Mac actually heats up.</li>
  <li>Settings clarifies that Thermal is system pressure, not how warm the case feels.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
